plasma.ppm: 400 x 400 pixels. Some of them, as red, green and blue:
    (0, 0): 0 255 255
    (399, 0): 0 215 255
    (0, 399): 0 255 200
    (399, 399): 252 0 255
    (200, 200): 151 255 0

The plasma in characters, a character for each tenth of its range, from low ( ) to high (@):
